name: ODFileSystem
description: Modern optical-disc filesystem for OS4
version: [VERSION]
author: Stefan Reinauer
submitter: Stefan Reinauer
email: stefan.reinauer@coreboot.org
url: https://github.com/reinauer/ODFileSystem
category: driver/filesystem
replaces: driver/filesystem/odfilesystem.lha
requirements: AmigaOS 4.1 Final Edition
license: BSD
minosversion: 4.1
distribute: yes
passphrase: [PASSPHRASE]
hend:
ODFileSystem is a read-only optical-disc filesystem for AmigaOS 4.
It supports ISO 9660, Rock Ridge, Joliet, UDF, HFS, HFS+, multisession
discs, and CDDA tracks exposed as virtual WAV or AIFF files.

This archive contains the native PowerPC disk-loadable handler,
the CDFileSystem Kickstart module, debug variants, and an audio-CD
Workbench icon. See README.md inside the archive for installation
instructions and mount options.

Source code and release notes:
https://github.com/reinauer/ODFileSystem/releases
